<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-FILDERSTADT WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FILDERSTADT WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>FILDERSTADT, Germany 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final</p>
<p>results in the $450,000 Filderstadt women's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>8-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat 1-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario</p>
<p>(Spain) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>5-Anke Huber (Germany) beat 2-Conchita Martinez (Spain) 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Judith Wiesner (Austria) beat 3-Iva Majoli (Croatia) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>4-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat 6-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
